  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Hidden Dragon Cave, after the super immortal formation is already half collapsed, Song Qi Yuan nods that it is ready, mutters lightly, and activates the move. Old Man Bei Feng and Feng Chan Zi are exposed inside the core. The killer move creates no commotion when first used, so the result catches people off-guard. It is Song Qi Yuan’s proud method, mostly used against stationary enemies like formations.",
